#! The quickfix round-trip. `grammar/semicolon.lu`'s E0002 carries the only
#! MACHINE-APPLICABLE suggestion in the sample set, so it is the one
#! diagnostic that becomes a code action. Three claims are pinned here:
#!
#!   * an action offered at the diagnostic's own range carries a fully
#!     resolved `edit` — facsimile cannot resolve lazily (report 09), so an
#!     action with a `data` blob and no edit is unusable for a tier-0 client;
#!   * the action's `diagnostics` array is the diagnostic it fixes, so a
#!     client can attribute it;
#!   * a range with no diagnostic in it yields an EMPTY array, not null — a
#!     lightbulb that appears on every line is a lightbulb users turn off.
name      requests/code-action-quickfix
profile   maximal

initialize
open      grammar/semicolon.lu
wait      diagnostics grammar/semicolon.lu
req       codeAction grammar/semicolon.lu 7:4-7:5
req       codeAction grammar/semicolon.lu 10:0-10:4
shutdown
